WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.134 --> 00:00:25.722
Jim: What's that, Miss Gray?

2
00:00:25.723 --> 00:00:29.118
Miss Gray: It's the wind, Jim.

3
00:00:29.119 --> 00:00:33.485
Kara: I don't like that noise.

4
00:00:33.486 --> 00:00:41.601
Mark: I do! It sounds like a monster howling.

5
00:00:41.602 --> 00:00:46.773
Jim: When's it going to stop blowing?

6
00:00:46.774 --> 00:00:48.754
Miss Gray: I'm not sure.

7
00:00:48.755 --> 00:00:53.694
Please finish up your math work, Jim.

8
00:00:53.695 --> 00:01:00.055
Mark: Here. It's your turn with the dice.

9
00:01:00.056 --> 00:01:04.674
Jim: I rolled a three.

10
00:01:04.675 --> 00:01:06.928
And now a four.

11
00:01:06.929 --> 00:01:12.446
Jim: Three times four is . . . twelve.

12
00:01:12.447 --> 00:01:18.411
Mark: Yep. I'll write down our answer.

13
00:01:18.412 --> 00:01:20.345
Class: Ooh!

14
00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:22.221
Kara: The lights went out!

15
00:01:22.222 --> 00:01:24.011
I don't like the dark!

16
00:01:24.012 --> 00:01:29.272
Jim: Me neither. Now it's raining really hard too.

17
00:01:29.273 --> 00:01:31.313
Miss Gray: Stay calm, everybody.

18
00:01:31.314 --> 00:01:43.616
I'm sure the power will come back on soon.

19
00:01:43.617 --> 00:01:46.726
Mr. Miller: The power is still out, everyone.

20
00:01:46.727 --> 00:01:51.276
Mr. Miller: So we are closing South Street School for the rest of the day.

21
00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:59.761
Mr. Miller: Please wait in your classrooms for your parents to come.

22
00:01:59.762 --> 00:02:02.631
Mark: Blackouts are so cool.

23
00:02:02.632 --> 00:02:05.726
We only had a half day of school!

24
00:02:05.727 --> 00:02:09.637
Coby: I'm glad you didn't lose power at your house.

25
00:02:09.638 --> 00:02:15.246
Mark: I know. We can still play video games.

26
00:02:15.247 --> 00:02:17.875
Coby: I thought Jim was coming over.

27
00:02:17.876 --> 00:02:21.138
Mark: I called his house, but no one answered.

28
00:02:21.139 --> 00:02:23.573
Coby: Maybe their phone isn't working.

29
00:02:23.574 --> 00:02:28.579
Let's go get him.

30
00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:31.935
Mark: Mom, can we walk to Jim's house?

31
00:02:31.936 --> 00:02:34.013
It stopped raining.

32
00:02:34.014 --> 00:02:41.354
Mrs. Conlan: Okay.

33
00:02:41.355 --> 00:02:43.262
Coby: Oh no!

34
00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:49.606
Mark: Look at Jim's house!
